# 빌드 산출물 (각 setup.sh 로 다시 만든다)
VMsetup/*-source/vendor
!VMsetup/license_assign-source/vendor
VMsetup/affinity_setting-source/affinity_setting
VMsetup/license_assign-source/license_assign
VMsetup/lpage_setting-source/lpage_setting
VMsetup/mac_info-source/mac_info
VMsetup/main_conn-source/main_conn
VMsetup/nic_assign-source/nic_assign
VMsetup/numa_preferht_setting-source/numa_preferht_setting
VMsetup/tag_setting-source/tag_setting
VMsetup/vm_create-source/vm_create
VMsetup/vswitch_setting-source/vswitch_setting
VMsetup/bin/
VMsetup/run_*/

# 실제 사용자 입력/결과 파일 (인프라 정보 — 저장소에 올리지 않음). 예시(*.example)와 예시 스펙 1개만 올린다.
VMsetup/*.txt
!VMsetup/*.txt.example
SPEC_DIR/*
!SPEC_DIR/README.md
!SPEC_DIR/*.example
!SPEC_DIR/TST-CAE001-SAMP48c-QRST/
